1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,666
In a longitudinal wave, the particles vibrate back and forth along the direction of travel.

2
00:00:06,666 --> 00:00:13,815
They crowd together in compressions, marked C, and spread apart in rarefactions, marked R.

3
00:00:13,815 --> 00:00:16,419
Sound in air is longitudinal.

